# The Rust release the trybuild snapshots (clingox/tests/ui/*.stderr) are made
# with. rustc words its diagnostics differently from release to release, and it
# shows excerpts of the standard library only when the `rust-src` component is
# installed, so the snapshots match exactly one setup: this release, with
# rust-src. `cargo xtask test compile-fail` checks both and runs the tests; CI
# runs it in one job on this toolchain and sets CLINGOX_SKIP_COMPILE_FAIL in
# every other job. To move the pin, install the new release with rust-src, run
# the tests with TRYBUILD=overwrite, review the diff, and change the version
# below in the same commit.
1.99.0
